  <item>
    <title>12.容貌焦虑、畸形审美、绝对干货！聊聊医美那些事儿</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658f9affbf3589e894715137</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658f9affbf3589e894715137</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Dec 2023 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong><span>米斯特杨，丁丁</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【嘉宾】</span></strong><span>贾医生（整形美容科医生）</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们邀请了专业医生，一起聊聊</span><strong><span>医美</span></strong><span>里的八卦和干货。</span></p><span></span><p><span>东方甄选前CEO为什么被大家吐槽</span><strong><span>面相不好？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>有明星花</span><strong><span>100W</span></strong><span>打一针国产水光针？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欲唇、精灵耳、高颅顶，怎么变成了</span><strong><span>畸形审美？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>25岁开始抗老，是不是有点儿早？</span></p><span></span><p><span>网上流传的医美攻略，哪些</span><strong><span>不靠谱？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>热玛吉、光子嫩肤、水光针、瘦脸针、皮秒、嗨体……五花八门的项目都有啥功效？又有</span><strong><span>哪些风险？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也有跟医美有关的故事，也欢迎留言跟大家分享~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容提到的一些冷知识：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>南方人比北方人更抗老？</span></p><span></span><p><span>胡萝卜吃多了会让人皮肤变黄！</span></p><span></span><p><span>皮肤越黑，做光电类美白的时长反而应该越短？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【↓↓传送门↓↓】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">03:42</a> 25岁真的就要开始“抗初老”了？南方人衰老更慢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="411">06:51</a> 不靠谱攻略：医美项目的时长必须做足？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">09:17</a> 冰冰VS吉克隽逸，皮肤越黑，做激光美白祛斑的时间反而要越短？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a> 欲唇、精灵耳、高颅顶，怎么变成了畸形审美？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">24:08</a> 那些大苹果肌、尖下巴的“蛇精脸”怎么消失了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 身边的医美销售：PUA客户、行走的活广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1797">29:57</a> 一个八卦：国内某知名女演员，花100W打了一针国产玻尿酸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1981">33:01</a> 美容院做水光、激光，违法又危险！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a> 瘦脸、除皱的“肉毒素”，有什么风险？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2613">43:33</a> 补水、塑形的“玻尿酸”，可能会堵塞血管？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2806">46:46</a> 想盲目整成明星脸？大夫说：明星的照片也是P的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3206">53:26</a> 所谓“抗老”，到底要抗什么？怎么抗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3369">56:09</a> 嗨体、冭活…这些怪名字都是啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3574">59:34</a> 皮秒？原理就像走进科学！是更高级的光子嫩肤？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3741">01:02:21</a> 收缩毛孔？这事儿有点复杂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3806">01:03:26</a> 打瘦脸针脸真的会变僵？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3946">01:05:46</a> 家用美容仪，真的不是智商税？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4025">01:07:05</a> 海蓝之谜、黑绷带…买大牌护肤品不如做医美？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面图来自于网络，如有侵权，联系删除。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvArLbNlFslE65O0NV0PgyJvpIvc.m4a" length="134816218" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZnTGY0RTFzTTdpX1JxZWI0STVMemFFdF9KdEcucG5n.png"/>
