  <item>
    <title>10.从《涉过愤怒的海》到受害者有罪论，电影和电影外的故事，在告诉我们什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6575befa8593f10bf9fa52fb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6575befa8593f10bf9fa52fb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Dec 2023 13:36:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong><span>米斯特杨，丁丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次我们聊聊正在热映的电影</span><strong><span>《涉过愤怒的海》</span></strong><span>，还有它牵涉出的一桩陈年旧案——</span><strong><span>邵童案</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们憋闷于电影里原生家庭对两个年轻人的非正向影响，同时愤怒于邵童案的凶手和偏颇的媒体报道角度。</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影中娜娜的扮演者演员周依然的微博里有一句话，是她送给娜娜的，我抄下来，送给所有受到同样困扰的朋友：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>你不爱喝牛奶，我不爱喝豆浆，牛奶豆浆没有错，我们也没有错。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【↓↓传送门↓↓】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="37">00:37</a> 怒海不怒，只是堵！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 全员疯批，是演员的解放天性还是导演的蓄谋已久？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a> 张宥浩&amp;周依然，年轻演员演技不行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="481">08:01</a> 不存在的“父爱”，成了复仇唯一的动力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="659">10:59</a> 剧中的</span><strong><span>金陨石</span></strong><span>，在现实生活里已经算是合格的父亲了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> 那些没有被放进电影里的原著情节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1124">18:44</a> 两个年轻人的世界：爱？没有！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1417">23:37</a> 疯狂表白：</span><strong><span>周依然</span></strong><span>在电影里太好看啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 电影到底有没有原型？江歌案还是</span><strong><span>邵童案</span></strong><span>？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1676">27:56</a> </span><strong><span>邵童案</span></strong><span>的来龙去脉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> 关于</span><strong><span>李向南</span></strong><span>是有预谋还是激情杀人的法庭大battle</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3513">58:33</a> 造黄谣、扒隐私，</span><strong><span>受害者有罪论</span></strong><span>什么时候才能停止？！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面图来自于网络，如有侵权，联系删除。</span></p>]]></description>
