  <item>
    <title>09.中国女巫勇闯俄罗斯灵异节目！玄学宇宙真的存在吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65584e128fb8b597a2957138</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65584e128fb8b597a2957138</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 Nov 2023 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong><span>米斯特杨，丁丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>俄罗斯有一档很火的灵异类综艺节目</span><strong><span>《通灵之战》</span></strong><span>，创办16年录制了22季。</span></p><span></span><p><span>四年前，有一位</span><strong><span>中国“女巫”</span></strong><span>勇闯俄罗斯，参与了这档节目的录制，一战封神。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年年底，这位“女巫”又要重返战场！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目，我们就来聊聊这档节目到底是怎么回事，以及中国“女巫”老李在节目里的几个高光时刻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你相信“通灵”存在，你可以把它当纪录片；</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你不相信“通灵”存在，你也可以把它当仙侠剧——看着刺激就够了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【↓↓传送门↓↓】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 16年22季！《通灵之战》的火爆你难以想象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">03:46</a> 通灵冠军严正声明：要相信科学！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> 粗暴定义：通灵是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="509">08:29</a> 中国“女巫”老李：我体内有一只狐狸！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> 小试牛刀：黑幕挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 一战封神：后备箱藏人挑战——找到的不是“活人”！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> &nbsp;学霸莫名坠楼 ，是恶魔的召唤还是凶手的手段？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> &nbsp;从“黑寡妇”到被“诅咒”的村庄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> &nbsp;车祸死亡的女孩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2513">41:53</a> &nbsp;场外加更：面试题目大揭秘！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2776">46:16</a> &nbsp;俄罗斯节目组的“抠搜”指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3324">55:24</a> &nbsp;通灵界怎么看“蓝可儿事件”？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3662">01:01:02</a> &nbsp;《通灵之战》史上人气王者：朱莉王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3848">01:04:08</a> &nbsp;老李又要去参加《通灵之战》啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面图素材来自于网络，如有侵权，联系删除。</span></p>]]></description>
