  <item>
    <title>07.世界“鬼节”大盘点：有人狂欢载歌载舞，有人展示故人头骨？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653d34ba2d3520c14f98b7ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653d34ba2d3520c14f98b7ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 29 Oct 2023 12:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong><span>米斯特杨，丁丁</span></p><span></span><p><span>全世界最著名的鬼节——“万圣节”要来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>除了万圣节，世界各地还有很多不同的鬼节。有的庄重肃穆、有的纵情狂欢，当然也有的阴气森森。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目，咱们来好好八一八全球各地不同的鬼节习俗。</span></p><span></span><p><span>中间有跑题的“东北五仙”来串场……</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Tips】</span></strong><span>我们觉得本期内容人畜无害，并不惊悚。大家应该可以放心收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面图及音乐均来源于网络，如有侵权，联系删除。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【传送门↓↓】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="101">01:41</a> 万圣节：确定不是为了给丰收的南瓜“清库存”才有的鬼节？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="707">11:47</a> 清明节：中华民族的隆重祭祖仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 中元节：百鬼夜行，生人避让。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> 插播一段怪奇故事：东北五仙过中元节吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a> 寒衣节：地府双十一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a> 日本盂兰盆节：居然可以放两周假！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2461">41:01</a> 墨西哥亡灵节：可能是全球最狂欢的鬼节！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 泰国鬼节：这就是鬼舞！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2944">49:04</a> 听名字就会怂系列：印尼“净尸节”、马达加斯加“翻尸节”、玻利维亚“头骨祈福日”</span></p>]]></description>
