  <item>
    <title>06.路边的红包不要捡？冥婚的精神内核</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652821a519dde7bf6a5d4de8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">652821a519dde7bf6a5d4de8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 14 Oct 2023 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近看了一部在环大陆地区上映的口碑票房双爆的电影</span><strong><span>《关于我和鬼变成家人的那件事》</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>电影里除了许光汉的屁股和恐同的话题，还几乎完整地展现了台湾地区</span><strong><span>配冥婚</span></strong><span>，从准备到实施再到结婚入洞房的全过程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关于冥婚这件事，你以为它很远，其实它很近；你以为它只是个封建糟粕的传说，实际上却很可能是一门生意，甚至是杀人理由。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一次，我们想跟你聊聊</span><strong><span>冥婚的精神内核</span></strong><span>，和它背后的“次生灾害”。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【Tips】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>播客中提到的两个生僻词：掷筊、司空掾邴原。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播】米斯特杨，丁丁</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【↓传送门↓】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 浅聊一下电影《鬼家人》&amp;许光汉的身材~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> 中国上下三千年的冥婚史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> &nbsp;中国台湾地区真的是找活人冥婚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 东南亚影视圈酷爱冥婚题材</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="616">10:16</a> 闽粤地区的冥婚：为“孤娘”找丈夫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 闽粤地区的冥婚流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1268">21:08</a> 冥婚之后，现实中的妻子要“贬妻为妾”？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 冥婚的精神内核：人类必须完成生殖使命？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 古代冥婚故事：曹操竟然给曹冲配冥婚！以及冥婚也能离婚？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1755">29:15</a> &nbsp;中国北方地区的冥婚流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1929">32:09</a> 为了给鬼找对象，冥婚界也有世纪“冥”缘！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2081">34:41</a> 冥婚催生的犯罪案件</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面图素材来自于网络，如有侵权，联系删除。</span></p>]]></description>
